  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Central African Forest Initiative (CAFI) - contribution under the Tropical Forest Initaitive</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish contribution to CAFI is part of the Tropical Forest Initiative, which has the overall objective to reduce deforestation  and degradation of national forest in response to global climate change, to protect biodiversity and to promote sustainable development.

The objective of the contribution to CAFI is to support investments and reforms to address forest loss and fight poverty in high-forest communities in the Congo Basin in Central Africa. The strategic objective of the engagement is to implement the Paris Agreement, fight poverty and develop sustainable and fulfill t the post-2020 biodiversity framework.</narrative>
  </description>
